+// DIAGNOSTIC (mount-pulse localization): does the .mgl/OSD mount ever reach the FPGA?
+// img_mounted_cnt counts img_mounted[0] rising edges; current_file_size latches img_size.
+// Surfaced on the uart X/Y fields (see uart_debug arx/ary feed) for a hands-off read:
+//   X(cnt)=0          -> img_mounted NEVER pulsed: mount not delivered (framework/.mgl/hps_io)
